Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-室友早  -早\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Morning, roomie.  - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天早上终于记得穿衣服了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You remembered to put clothes on this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事不过五嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fifth day's a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  能搬回来真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh Joey, it's so great to be back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真帮了我跟艾玛一个大忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're making it so easy on me and Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能回来也很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's great having you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要待多久就待多久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stay as long as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.03,0:00:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是她什么时候才不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And when does she stop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整宿的哭呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}crying all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.83,0:00:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然没有光着屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! You're not naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.57,0:00:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你今晚什么时候回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, when will we expect to see you tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我大概六点回来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I probably be back around 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在房间里呢  已经收拾好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But she's in the bedroom, all ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可她又睡着了  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But she did fell back to sleep, so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她可能因为昨晚忙着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's probably exhausted from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.82,0:00:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,制造美妙的哭声累坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}all that adorable screaming she did last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.86,0:00:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-再见  -再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Bye.  - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望艾玛没有给你带来太多麻烦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I hope Emma isn't making it too hard on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没  一切都很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, hey, it's been great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.34,0:00:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得跟你说  虽然瑞秋住在这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just want you to know that with Rachel staying here...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.13,0:00:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我之前对她的感觉  已经没了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}all my feelings from before are totally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使本来还有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And even if they weren't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你看到一个女人用吸奶器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when you walk in on a woman using a breast pump
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  效果显着  -哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Yeah, that'll do it.  - Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎样呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.83,0:01:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不错啊  -真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- I'm okay.  - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.14,0:01:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  要是问我  有没有希望过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. I mean, do I wish
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.45,0:01:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以和瑞秋幸福地生活在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}me and Rachel living together would have worked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course. You know, I'm disappointed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是有点失望  可毕竟这又不是离婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but it's not like it's a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上这…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, actually it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是离婚  这不是离婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not a divorce. It is not a divorce!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我跟瑞秋  都应该过自己的新生活了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, I think Rachel and I need to get on with our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许应该开始跟其他人交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe start seeing other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  为何不呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.11,0:01:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  你认不认识适合我的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, if you know anyone that'd be good for me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.31,0:01:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我认识很多女生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. I know lots of girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想到谁了  说个名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any names come to mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.90,0:01:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Names?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《老友记》  第九季 第14集  相亲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends S09E14 The One With The Blind Dates
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正要吃东西  你要吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was about to eat. Want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看看  有豆泥 胡萝卜泥…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, let's see, we got strained peas, strained carrots...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.91,0:02:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅子泥  还没有试过这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}strained plums. We haven't tried that yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.65,0:02:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Goody!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.59,0:02:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟瑞秋重新住一起感觉如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how is it living with Rachel again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  除了有很多好吃的之外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, apart from the great food?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  很好  只是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm fine, I'm fine. It's just....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.31,0:02:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她跟罗斯之间真的是很诡异\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just weird what's happening with her and Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天他居然要我介绍女生给他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yesterday he asked me to fix him up with somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋也问我有没有男生可以介绍给她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel asked me if I knew anyone for her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:02:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他们为什么要这样呢  -不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Why are they doing this?  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.37,0:03:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们彼此再适合不过了  真是神经\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're so perfect for each other. It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么才神经  这些罐子是怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what's crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才两口就没了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These jars. It's like two bits in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望他们可以发现  他俩是天生一对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wish they'd realize they should be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们又住在一起的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know. When they moved in together,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为事情就解决了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I figured that's where things were headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.66,0:03:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  他们应该是一家人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. They should be a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.06,0:03:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结婚生更多的小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They should marry and have more children.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.11,0:03:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  还该把其中一个取名叫乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. And they should name one of their kids Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我或许不会有小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I may not have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.71,0:03:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总是要有人帮我把我的姓传下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Someone's gotta carry on the family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.51,0:03:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许他们一旦开始跟别人约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? Maybe once they start dating
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道别人是怎样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and see what's out there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.43,0:03:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就会发现彼此是多么适合\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}they'll realize how good they are for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他俩真是绝配啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, because it is slim pickings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我昨晚约会的女生遭透了  讨厌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had this date last night. Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们说话小声点  她还在房间里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But we should probably keep it down, she's still in the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.66,0:03:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道真要帮他们介绍别人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are we just gonna set them up with people?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只会使他们渐行渐远\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, that just pushes them further and further apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.07,0:03:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道要怎么做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know what we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.56,0:03:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们帮罗斯跟瑞秋介绍糟糕的约会对象\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We could set Ross and Rachel up on horrible dates...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以使他们意识到彼此才是归宿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so they'll realize how good they are together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.40,0:04:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-真是好计划  -没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- That's a great plan.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.71,0:04:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道最棒的是什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what the best part of it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我终于可以用到计划笑声了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I get to do my plan laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停  不要那么大声  不要吵醒那个谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, shh! Not so loud. We don't want to wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们今晚没事  对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. You guys aren't doing anything tonight, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你凭什么这么以为呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, now, why would you assume that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就因为我们是已婚吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just because we're married?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你知道 我们可是非常时髦又充实的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I will have you know that we are very hip, happening people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.77,0:04:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  不好意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now if you'll excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.87,0:04:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要继续读报上的讣告了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to get back to reading the obituaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是问问  因为今晚我需要人帮我带艾玛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was just asking because I need someone to watch Emma tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们当然帮你带  你要干什么去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure we'll do it. What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比帮我安排一个约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Phoebe set me up on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  有什么不对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你跟罗斯是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I figured because you and Ross are--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是怎样  一年半前上过床吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Slept together a year and a half ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我已经好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.03,0:05:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你去约会是件好事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think it's great you're going on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来很健康\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It sounds healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也有你的需要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you have needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放手拥抱你的女性特质吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Embrace your womanhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要找工作吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少看欧普拉  多投简历去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Turn off Oprah and send out  resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我大概七点带她过来好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll bring her by around 7, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.29,0:05:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会过很开心的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys are gonna have so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她现在正是可爱的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's at such a cute age.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几件事注意一下  现在她会吃固体食物了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A couple things. Now that she eats solid food,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以会按时排便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}she poops around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有小心你的头发  她喜欢抓着不放\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And watch out for your hair because she likes to grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她这个年龄阶段\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's also in this phase
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还会在你离开房间的时候拼命尖叫  但是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}where if you leave the room, she screams, but....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢啦  祝你们玩得开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks, you guys. Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,突然间  我希望读到讣告里有自己的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Suddenly I wish I was reading my own name.
