Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -我是说  拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- What?  - Look, I mean, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可不是我可以高攀的起的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you're way out of my league.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里人人都看得出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everybody in here knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我敢说那边那个人  正在这么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I bet that guy over there is probably saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.75,0:11:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"她怎么会跟他约会呢"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}''Why's she out with him?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"一定是他很有钱"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"He must be rich.''
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:11:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是  我没钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想吃点什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you think you want to order?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好想吃这家的鸡肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm real excited about that chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.39,0:12:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不风趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not funny, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果你是在想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So if you were thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"他长得不怎么样"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Well, he's not that good-looking..."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"但也许他是个幽默的人"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"but maybe we'll have some laughs,''
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.47,0:12:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that ain't gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  史提夫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, come on, Steve,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别打断我紧张的苦笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}let's not rule out nervous laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  菲比告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, now, wait a minute, Phoebe told me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.94,0:12:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己有家餐厅  很了不起啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that you owned your own restaurant. That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经没了  因为吸毒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I lost it to drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在卖印的T恤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I silk-screen T-shirts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的啊  工作怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? What's that like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做一个你痛恨  又赚不到钱的工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's really fulfilling doing something
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是非常充实啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you hate for no money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.82,0:12:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我没有钱  我不风趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. I have no money, I'm not funny...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还住在一个  只有一室的房子里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I live in a studio apartment
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是跟两个男人合租的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with two other guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.39,0:13:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还很确定  我有不育症\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm pretty sure l'm infertile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  别这样  史提夫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, come on. Come on, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定有对自己满意的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There must be something that you like about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.23,0:13:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒是挺满意我的头发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do like my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-哈啰  -菲比  是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Hello?  - Phoebe, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要追杀到你  然后把你给剁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to hunt you down and kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.34,0:13:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是史上最烂的约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is the worst date ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.11,0:13:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么给我介绍这么个怪胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How could you set me up with this creep?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.47,0:13:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你说的可是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, you are talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.69,0:13:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最要好  最要好的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}one of my dear, dear friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不管  这人简直就是个恶梦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't care. This guy is a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  他只在嗑完药的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, so he gets a little crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才有点失常\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when he's stoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.03,0:14:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没嗑药\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's not stoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他有出去抽烟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did he go out for a cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.63,0:14:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-有啊  四次  -我亲爱的甜姐儿瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Yeah. Four times.  - My dear, sweet Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的计划奏效了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, our plan is working.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋现在如坐针毡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel's having a miserable time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而罗斯被人放了鸽子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and Ross is stood up somewhere at a restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正在某家餐厅里呆坐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们很快就会重归于好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pretty soon they'll be back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.71,0:14:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等到大家发现我们做的好事时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}By the time anyone's figured out what we've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们早就在阳光普照的墨西哥了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we'll be in sunny Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  这是另一个计划的结局\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait, that's the end of a different plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她睡着了  钱德勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's asleep. Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.35,0:14:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾玛也这样做啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emma was doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她睡着了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她睡了  那就表示我们可以…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's asleep. That means we can....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.25,0:14:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但是我们动作必须要快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. But we have to be fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我尽量\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay, I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你不能发出任何声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you can't make any noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  我尽量\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.51,0:14:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾玛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.51,0:15:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.98,0:15:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗  你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How are you? How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的保姆们呢  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where are your babysitters, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卧房的门怎么关了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why is the bedroom door closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在照顾哇哇的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't have S-E-X
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能上床啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when you're taking care of a B-A-B-I-E.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个坏消息  那个中国人走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've got bad news. The Chinese guy left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,命里有时终须有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If it was meant to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,命里无时莫强求\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it's meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被放鸽子又能怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, you got stood up. Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们来好好招待你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're gonna show you a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就坐着享受吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sit and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我要免费招待您一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, let me bring you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.76,0:15:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蟹肉饼开胃菜吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}a crab-cake appetizer on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  免费的蟹肉饼吗  真是周到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, free crab cakes? Well, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.73,0:16:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我本来希望今晚可以嘿咻一下的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Although I was hoping to have sex tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要蟹肉饼就行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just the crab cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.27,0:16:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛  是要让他留下来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? Are you trying to get him to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能这样做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要多管闲事好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just get out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  这是怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,服务生们都在打赌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, the waiters have a little pool going.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赌你会等多久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have a bet on how long it'll take
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才会放弃回家去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}before you give up and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然拿我的痛苦来赢钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're making money off my misery?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你待到九点二十的话  我就赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if you stay till 9:20, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太离谱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一生从未被如此羞辱过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have never been so insulted in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.24,0:16:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  如果你帮我把蟹肉饼打包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, if you'll wrap up my free crab cakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就马上离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你倒是很大声  反而我倒是挺快的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were loud and I was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.35,0:16:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们这一次会成功\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think we may have really done it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.17,0:16:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都等不及去作验孕测试\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wish l didn't have to wait to take a pregnancy test.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可能需要再多买一些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You may want to get some more of those too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾玛呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where's Emma?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  艾玛呢  艾玛呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, where's Emma? Where's Emma?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别问我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一起在里面滚床单呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was in there canoodling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.89,0:17:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是瑞秋提早回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Okay. I'm sure that Rachel came home early
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.50,0:17:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把艾玛带回去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and picked up Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去对面看看  我来打电话给她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You go look across the hall, and I'll call her cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好祈祷我有怀孕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You better hope we're pregnant...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为无论如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}because one way or another,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都得有个孩子还给瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we're giving a baby back to Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信我在你面前哭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe I'm crying in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定觉得我很可悲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You must think I'm so pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不  我欣赏会哭的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no, I admire a man who can cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-真的  -别碰我的外套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Really?  - Don't touch my coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我有电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry, that's my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-哈啰  -嘿  瑞秋  约会如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Hello?  - Hey, Rach, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  这是我有过最烂的约会了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, this is the worst date ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  少来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.56,0:17:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, you know what, I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你觉得一切进行的很顺利吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but did you really think that this was going well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了  -你有来过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- What's up?  - Hey, did you stop by here?
