Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也太懒了  就不能有一次在上面吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are so lazy. Can't you get on top for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.91,0:18:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  好啦  我们是在做爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. All right, we were.
