Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.77,0:18:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们居然在里面做爱  不能接受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with Emma in the next room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须要告诉瑞秋这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll have to tell Rachel about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托不要  她会杀了我们的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please don't. She will kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.79,0:18:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要  除非…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I gotta. Unless....
