Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.02,0:20:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果对方没有出现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But is it technically a date
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.27,0:20:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那到底算不算是约会呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}if the other person doesn't show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是觉得  她看到你就走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. Do you think she walked in, saw you and left?
